    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d619">

                <pb facs="1041" n="945" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg945"/>

                <head>No. 617.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">General Sickles to Mr. Fish.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1873-11-16"><hi rendition="#italic">November</hi> 16,
                        1873</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Informed minister of state officially by note of the further executions mentioned
                    in your cable of 15th. President Castelar sent me a message by his secretary,
                    stating that the captain-general, in a telegram of same date, denies truth of
                    report.</p>
                <closer><signed>SICKLES.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
